{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-coral-reef","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"coral-reef","about":"Embark on a remarkable journey to the enchanting realm of Coral Reef, an architectural marvel within Dubai Maritime City meticulously crafted by Damac Properties. A symphony of luxury and artistic expression, Coral Reef is a testament to the convergence of luxury and creativity. This visionary residential project introduces an elevated waterfront lifestyle, where the rhythm of the sea harmonizes with contemporary living, creating a space that redefines modern elegance.Nestled within this vibrant canvas, Coral Reef unveils a unique chapter of luxury living. Here, the charm of upscale residences harmonizes with the allure of exclusive Babolex sculptures, a creation of acclaimed French artist Vincent Faudemer. This artistic collaboration renders Coral Reef a singular experience, where each sculpture becomes a distinctive symbol of wonder within the tower’s graceful embrace. Beyond the artistic expressions, Coral Reef unfolds a series of offerings that redefine modern living. With a selection of carefully designed 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, residents are presented with choices that suit their preferences and needs. From top-notch amenities that redefine comfort to meticulously crafted interiors that exude contemporary elegance, every facet has been thoughtfully curated to provide an unmatched living experience.","price":1600000,"title":"Coral Reef","bitrix":{"id":302,"pf_id":"are.2.12968","source":null,"project_id":"Coral Reef","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Coral Reef","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"DAMAC Properties","project_location":"Maritime City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/coral_feature_360749c875.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/coral_feature_360749c875.webp"}],"status":"pen